MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 75e7bea227aaf2b499307efe1ddc0480, type: 3}
  m_Name: MiraDialog_Act3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialog
  NPCName: Mira
  DialogLines:
  - text: I have never liked it down here.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Undercroft.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Stay close, Chief. This place was not designed to feel welcoming.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The workers here operate in the background. They always have.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Their purpose is to watch. To count. To record.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Every movement through the town. Every pattern. Every visit.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: This is how the town learns where it is failing. Where it can do better.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Not everyone agrees that such a record should be kept at all.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The keepers here will explain what they track. I will not speak for them.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Take your time with them, Chief. This is not a decision to rush.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
